<TextPage title="Privacy policy" description="The launch privacy posture for a static, account-free publication." noindex={true}>
  <p><strong>Provisional document.</strong> The production operator, jurisdiction, contact, and final measurement stack have not been approved. This page remains noindex and is not a substitute for the launch legal policy.</p>
  <h2>Launch data minimization</h2><ul><li>No user accounts.</li><li>No public prompt form.</li><li>No comments or uploads.</li><li>No third-party advertising scripts.</li><li>No profiling of sexual interests.</li></ul>
  <h2>Server and delivery logs</h2><p>The hosting and security provider may process ordinary request metadata such as IP address, user agent, time, and requested URL. The final policy will identify the operator and provider before production launch.</p>
  <h2>Benchmark data</h2><p>Provider credentials, raw private prompts, and explicit model outputs are not shipped to the public site. Public results are sanitized before build.</p>
</TextPage>
